"""build_summary.py - rebuild dolos/SIMPLE_SUMMARY.html, the one-table summary of every experiment for a young reader.

    uv run scripts/build_summary.py            # writes dolos/SIMPLE_SUMMARY.html
    uv run scripts/build_summary.py --out X    # somewhere else

Ported from the hunt's summary generator (2026-10-26). The row texts are the hunt's own words; each row's title is
now the experiment's AI-safety name (its folder name), with the old hunt code in small grey text after it, and the
report link points at the new folder.
"""
